  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The Azure mobile app now comes in dark theme.&nbsp; Dark mode may reduce eye strain and prolong the battery life of your smartphone.&nbsp; This highly requested feature is now available in the app stores, so you can now choose Dark or Light theme for your Azure mobile app experience.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/features/azure-portal/mobile-app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/customercomms/media/azureupdates/_migrated/38cdbf12-dbf2-40c5-8bbd-760595e8279b.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"dark theme\" src=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/customercomms/media/azureupdates/_migrated/1575b15e-a4e1-4f2e-85e3-f5636e2e3fab.png\" title=\"dark theme\"></a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The Azure mobile app now comes in dark theme. Dark mode may reduce eye strain and prolong the battery life of your smartphone. This highly requested feature is now available in the app stores, so you can now choose Dark or Light theme for your Azure mobile app experience.\n\nLearn more ."
  },
